{
  "name": "Inner Sun",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can expend 1 to 10 Ki Points as an Action and bathe the area in a 30-foot Emanation in a blinding light. Each creature of your choice in the area has to make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed save, a target takes 1d10 radiant damage per Ki Point spent and is Blinded until the end of your next turn. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and isn't Blinded.</p>",
